  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1313.26 Insulating Wood Floors A school bus chassis may be equipped with plywood floors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1313.26 Insulating Wood Floors A school bus chassis may be equipped with plywood floors. If so equipped, the plywood floor insulation shall be at least ½ inch thick and meet the requirements of Saf-C 1308.17(c).\n\nSource. #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
